{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ruby Journey</strong> is an immersive sim taking place <strong>in a village</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You arrive with just <strong>one</strong>\u00a0<strong>gold</strong>, and you want their <strong>ruby</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trade</strong>, do <strong>quests</strong>, manage your resources wisely to <strong>get richer</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to PNJs and <strong>grow friendships</strong>, all while discovering their <strong>lore</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Befriend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've officially come to help the village to recover from its recent hardships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accomplish the locals' quests to gain their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499630/extras/gif102017.gif?t=1740931699\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you help a local, the more trades he propose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499630/extras/gif83887.gif?t=1740931699\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enrich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tools are the engine of your economic growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499630/extras/gif14665.gif?t=1740931699\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hamlet is also a story. Learn more about what happened recently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499630/extras/gif70004.gif?t=1740931699\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p